<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="67955b26">&lt;p&gt;
    A project&amp;nbsp;schedule emerges when you apply the constraints of:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task interdependencies
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Available time
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Available people
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Be prepared to iterate until you have a workable plan.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
